{"id":"496cf1f6601b47fe","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-prop-countable-support.md","title":"Countable Support Iteration","display":"prop-countable-support — Countable Support Iteration","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-prop-countable-support","aliases":["58-prop-countable-support"],"display":"prop-countable-support — Countable Support Iteration","depends_on":["[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-countable-support-iteration-system.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-proper.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-transitive-model.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-name.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-prop-countable-support"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-prop-countable-support</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-countable-support — Countable Support Iteration"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3f578666c473032f\" href=\"?note=3f578666c473032f\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-zfc-countable-support-iteration-system.md\">../batch09/58-df-zfc-countable-support-iteration-system.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8935dcac821c0104\" href=\"?note=8935dcac821c0104\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-proper.md\">../batch06/58-df-proper.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"911508dbd8495663\" href=\"?note=911508dbd8495663\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md\">../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a9132c2c1a18acd1\" href=\"?note=a9132c2c1a18acd1\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-zfc-transitive-model.md\">../batch19/58-df-zfc-transitive-model.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"ec28b62254928d73\" href=\"?note=ec28b62254928d73\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-name.md\">../batch07/58-df-name.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,\\vec I,\\vec{\\leq},u,\\delta,\\operatorname{Star},\\operatorname{Supp},\\mathbf1\\in V\">\\(M,\\vec I,\\vec{\\leq},u,\\delta,\\operatorname{Star},\\operatorname{Supp},\\mathbf1\\in V\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec I=\\langle P,Q\\rangle\">\\(\\vec I=\\langle P,Q\\rangle\\)</span> consists of the stage-carrier function <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> and the iterand-name function <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec{\\leq}(\\alpha)\">\\(\\vec{\\leq}(\\alpha)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u(\\alpha)\">\\(u(\\alpha)\\)</span> are respectively the order and greatest condition of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P(\\alpha)\">\\(P(\\alpha)\\)</span>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf1(\\alpha)\">\\(\\mathbf1(\\alpha)\\)</span> is the name of the greatest condition in the <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-th iterand.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta_\\in(v_0,v_1)\">\\(\\theta_\\in(v_0,v_1)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta_{\\leq}(v_0,v_1,v_2)\">\\(\\theta_{\\leq}(v_0,v_1,v_2)\\)</span> abbreviate <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_0\\in v_1\">\\(v_0\\in v_1\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle v_0,v_1\\rangle\\in v_2\">\\(\\langle v_0,v_1\\rangle\\in v_2\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta_{\\mathrm{proper}}(v_0,v_1)\">\\(\\theta_{\\mathrm{proper}}(v_0,v_1)\\)</span> is the membership-language expansion of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProperForcing}_S(v_0,v_1,\\mathcal L_\\in)\">\\(\\mathrm{ProperForcing}_S(v_0,v_1,\\mathcal L_\\in)\\)</span> from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"8935dcac821c0104\" href=\"?note=8935dcac821c0104\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-proper.md\">../batch06/58-df-proper.md</a>; the quotation codes of these three formulas belong to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma_\\in)\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma_\\in)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CountableSupportIterationSystem}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{CountableSupportIterationSystem}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProperForcing}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ProperForcing}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> have their exact upstream signatures.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Name}\">\\(\\mathrm{Name}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\\)</span> are the ground-model, forcing-name, ordered-set, and six-argument forcing predicates from the dependencies.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}countable-support}\\vdash\n\\forall P,Q\\in V\\;\\Bigl(&amp;\n\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S(M)\n\\land\\delta,\\vec I,\\vec{\\leq},u,\\operatorname{Star},\\operatorname{Supp},\\mathbf1\\in M\n\\land\\vec I=\\langle P,Q\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{CountableSupportIterationSystem}_S\n(\\vec I,\\delta,\\operatorname{Star},\\operatorname{Supp},\\mathbf1)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec{\\leq},\\delta+1,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec{\\leq}))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(u,\\delta+1,\\operatorname{ran}(u))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in\\delta+1\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{Poset}(P(\\lambda),\\vec{\\leq}(\\lambda))\n\\land u(\\lambda)\\in P(\\lambda)\n\\land\\forall p\\in P(\\lambda)\\;(\\langle p,u(\\lambda)\\rangle\\in\\vec{\\leq}(\\lambda))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{35mm}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(u(\\lambda),\\lambda,M)\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\lambda\\;(u(\\lambda)(\\alpha)=\\mathbf1(\\alpha))\n\\Bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\delta\\;\\exists\\dot Q_\\alpha,\\dot{\\leq}_\\alpha,\\dot1_\\alpha\\in M\\;\\Bigl[\nQ(\\alpha)=\\langle\\dot Q_\\alpha,\\dot{\\leq}_\\alpha,\\dot1_\\alpha\\rangle\n\\land\\mathbf1(\\alpha)=\\dot1_\\alpha\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{26mm}\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in\\{\\dot Q_\\alpha,\\dot{\\leq}_\\alpha,\\dot1_\\alpha\\}\\;\n\\mathrm{Name}(\\sigma,P(\\alpha))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{26mm}\\land P(\\alpha+1)=\\Bigl\\{p\\in V:\n\\mathrm{Function}(p,\\alpha+1,M)\n\\land p\\upharpoonright\\alpha\\in P(\\alpha)\n\\land\\mathrm{Name}(p(\\alpha),P(\\alpha))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{58mm}\\land\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\n(M,p\\upharpoonright\\alpha,\\ulcorner\\theta_\\in\\urcorner,\n\\langle p(\\alpha),\\dot Q_\\alpha\\rangle,\nP(\\alpha),\\vec{\\leq}(\\alpha))\\Bigr\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{26mm}\\land\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\n(M,u(\\alpha),\\ulcorner\\theta_{\\mathrm{proper}}\\urcorner,\n\\langle\\dot Q_\\alpha,\\dot{\\leq}_\\alpha\\rangle,\nP(\\alpha),\\vec{\\leq}(\\alpha))\n\\Bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in\\delta+1\\;\\forall p,q\\in P(\\lambda)\\;\\Bigl(\n\\langle q,p\\rangle\\in\\vec{\\leq}(\\lambda)\\leftrightarrow\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{20mm}\\forall\\alpha\\in\\lambda\\;\\exists\\dot Q_\\alpha,\\dot{\\leq}_\\alpha,\\dot1_\\alpha\\in M\\;\\bigl[\nQ(\\alpha)=\\langle\\dot Q_\\alpha,\\dot{\\leq}_\\alpha,\\dot1_\\alpha\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{49mm}\\land\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\n(M,q\\upharpoonright\\alpha,\\ulcorner\\theta_{\\leq}\\urcorner,\n\\langle q(\\alpha),p(\\alpha),\\dot{\\leq}_\\alpha\\rangle,\nP(\\alpha),\\vec{\\leq}(\\alpha))\\bigr]\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\mathrm{ProperForcing}_S(P(\\delta),\\vec{\\leq}(\\delta),\\mathcal L_\\in)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}countable-support}\\vdash\n\\forall P,Q\\in V\\;\\Bigl(&amp;\n\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S(M)\n\\land\\delta,\\vec I,\\vec{\\leq},u,\\operatorname{Star},\\operatorname{Supp},\\mathbf1\\in M\n\\land\\vec I=\\langle P,Q\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{CountableSupportIterationSystem}_S\n(\\vec I,\\delta,\\operatorname{Star},\\operatorname{Supp},\\mathbf1)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec{\\leq},\\delta+1,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec{\\leq}))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(u,\\delta+1,\\operatorname{ran}(u))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in\\delta+1\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{Poset}(P(\\lambda),\\vec{\\leq}(\\lambda))\n\\land u(\\lambda)\\in P(\\lambda)\n\\land\\forall p\\in P(\\lambda)\\;(\\langle p,u(\\lambda)\\rangle\\in\\vec{\\leq}(\\lambda))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{35mm}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(u(\\lambda),\\lambda,M)\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\lambda\\;(u(\\lambda)(\\alpha)=\\mathbf1(\\alpha))\n\\Bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\delta\\;\\exists\\dot Q_\\alpha,\\dot{\\leq}_\\alpha,\\dot1_\\alpha\\in M\\;\\Bigl[\nQ(\\alpha)=\\langle\\dot Q_\\alpha,\\dot{\\leq}_\\alpha,\\dot1_\\alpha\\rangle\n\\land\\mathbf1(\\alpha)=\\dot1_\\alpha\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{26mm}\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in\\{\\dot Q_\\alpha,\\dot{\\leq}_\\alpha,\\dot1_\\alpha\\}\\;\n\\mathrm{Name}(\\sigma,P(\\alpha))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{26mm}\\land P(\\alpha+1)=\\Bigl\\{p\\in V:\n\\mathrm{Function}(p,\\alpha+1,M)\n\\land p\\upharpoonright\\alpha\\in P(\\alpha)\n\\land\\mathrm{Name}(p(\\alpha),P(\\alpha))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{58mm}\\land\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\n(M,p\\upharpoonright\\alpha,\\ulcorner\\theta_\\in\\urcorner,\n\\langle p(\\alpha),\\dot Q_\\alpha\\rangle,\nP(\\alpha),\\vec{\\leq}(\\alpha))\\Bigr\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{26mm}\\land\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\n(M,u(\\alpha),\\ulcorner\\theta_{\\mathrm{proper}}\\urcorner,\n\\langle\\dot Q_\\alpha,\\dot{\\leq}_\\alpha\\rangle,\nP(\\alpha),\\vec{\\leq}(\\alpha))\n\\Bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in\\delta+1\\;\\forall p,q\\in P(\\lambda)\\;\\Bigl(\n\\langle q,p\\rangle\\in\\vec{\\leq}(\\lambda)\\leftrightarrow\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{20mm}\\forall\\alpha\\in\\lambda\\;\\exists\\dot Q_\\alpha,\\dot{\\leq}_\\alpha,\\dot1_\\alpha\\in M\\;\\bigl[\nQ(\\alpha)=\\langle\\dot Q_\\alpha,\\dot{\\leq}_\\alpha,\\dot1_\\alpha\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{49mm}\\land\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\n(M,q\\upharpoonright\\alpha,\\ulcorner\\theta_{\\leq}\\urcorner,\n\\langle q(\\alpha),p(\\alpha),\\dot{\\leq}_\\alpha\\rangle,\nP(\\alpha),\\vec{\\leq}(\\alpha))\\bigr]\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\mathrm{ProperForcing}_S(P(\\delta),\\vec{\\leq}(\\delta),\\mathcal L_\\in)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The five arguments of the upstream iteration-system predicate are all supplied. Successor carriers, the coordinatewise forced order, stage tops, name typing, and the fixed properness formula code are explicit rather than hidden in indexed notation.</li>\n<li>Countable-support iterations of proper iterands preserve properness; the conclusion calls the canonical three-argument properness predicate with the stage order and membership language.</li>\n<li>This preserves <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1\">\\(\\omega_1\\)</span> through the iteration.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch09/58-df-zfc-countable-support-iteration-system.md","status":"resolved","id":"3f578666c473032f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-countable-support-iteration-system.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-proper.md","status":"resolved","id":"8935dcac821c0104","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-proper.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md","status":"resolved","id":"911508dbd8495663","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-zfc-transitive-model.md","status":"resolved","id":"a9132c2c1a18acd1","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-transitive-model.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-name.md","status":"resolved","id":"ec28b62254928d73","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-name.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-proper.md","status":"resolved","id":"8935dcac821c0104","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\theta_{\\mathrm{proper}}(v_0,v_1)$ is the membership-language expansion of $\\mathrm{ProperForcing}_S(v_0,v_1,\\mathcal L_\\in)$ from [[../batch06/58-df-proper.md]]; the quotation codes of these three formulas belong to $\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma_\\in)$.","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,\\vec I,\\vec{\\leq},u,\\delta,\\operatorname{Star},\\operatorname{Supp},\\mathbf1\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec I=\\langle P,Q\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec{\\leq}(\\alpha)","display":false},{"tex":"u(\\alpha)","display":false},{"tex":"P(\\alpha)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf1(\\alpha)","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta_\\in(v_0,v_1)","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta_{\\leq}(v_0,v_1,v_2)","display":false},{"tex":"v_0\\in v_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle v_0,v_1\\rangle\\in v_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta_{\\mathrm{proper}}(v_0,v_1)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProperForcing}_S(v_0,v_1,\\mathcal L_\\in)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma_\\in)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CountableSupportIterationSystem}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProperForcing}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Name}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Poset}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}countable-support}\\vdash\n\\forall P,Q\\in V\\;\\Bigl(&\n\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S(M)\n\\land\\delta,\\vec I,\\vec{\\leq},u,\\operatorname{Star},\\operatorname{Supp},\\mathbf1\\in M\n\\land\\vec I=\\langle P,Q\\rangle\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{CountableSupportIterationSystem}_S\n(\\vec I,\\delta,\\operatorname{Star},\\operatorname{Supp},\\mathbf1)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec{\\leq},\\delta+1,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec{\\leq}))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(u,\\delta+1,\\operatorname{ran}(u))\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in\\delta+1\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{Poset}(P(\\lambda),\\vec{\\leq}(\\lambda))\n\\land u(\\lambda)\\in P(\\lambda)\n\\land\\forall p\\in P(\\lambda)\\;(\\langle p,u(\\lambda)\\rangle\\in\\vec{\\leq}(\\lambda))\\\\\n&\\hspace{35mm}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(u(\\lambda),\\lambda,M)\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\lambda\\;(u(\\lambda)(\\alpha)=\\mathbf1(\\alpha))\n\\Bigr]\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\delta\\;\\exists\\dot Q_\\alpha,\\dot{\\leq}_\\alpha,\\dot1_\\alpha\\in M\\;\\Bigl[\nQ(\\alpha)=\\langle\\dot Q_\\alpha,\\dot{\\leq}_\\alpha,\\dot1_\\alpha\\rangle\n\\land\\mathbf1(\\alpha)=\\dot1_\\alpha\\\\\n&\\hspace{26mm}\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in\\{\\dot Q_\\alpha,\\dot{\\leq}_\\alpha,\\dot1_\\alpha\\}\\;\n\\mathrm{Name}(\\sigma,P(\\alpha))\\\\\n&\\hspace{26mm}\\land P(\\alpha+1)=\\Bigl\\{p\\in V:\n\\mathrm{Function}(p,\\alpha+1,M)\n\\land p\\upharpoonright\\alpha\\in P(\\alpha)\n\\land\\mathrm{Name}(p(\\alpha),P(\\alpha))\\\\\n&\\hspace{58mm}\\land\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\n(M,p\\upharpoonright\\alpha,\\ulcorner\\theta_\\in\\urcorner,\n\\langle p(\\alpha),\\dot Q_\\alpha\\rangle,\nP(\\alpha),\\vec{\\leq}(\\alpha))\\Bigr\\}\\\\\n&\\hspace{26mm}\\land\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\n(M,u(\\alpha),\\ulcorner\\theta_{\\mathrm{proper}}\\urcorner,\n\\langle\\dot Q_\\alpha,\\dot{\\leq}_\\alpha\\rangle,\nP(\\alpha),\\vec{\\leq}(\\alpha))\n\\Bigr]\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in\\delta+1\\;\\forall p,q\\in P(\\lambda)\\;\\Bigl(\n\\langle q,p\\rangle\\in\\vec{\\leq}(\\lambda)\\leftrightarrow\\\\\n&\\hspace{20mm}\\forall\\alpha\\in\\lambda\\;\\exists\\dot Q_\\alpha,\\dot{\\leq}_\\alpha,\\dot1_\\alpha\\in M\\;\\bigl[\nQ(\\alpha)=\\langle\\dot Q_\\alpha,\\dot{\\leq}_\\alpha,\\dot1_\\alpha\\rangle\\\\\n&\\hspace{49mm}\\land\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\n(M,q\\upharpoonright\\alpha,\\ulcorner\\theta_{\\leq}\\urcorner,\n\\langle q(\\alpha),p(\\alpha),\\dot{\\leq}_\\alpha\\rangle,\nP(\\alpha),\\vec{\\leq}(\\alpha))\\bigr]\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\to\\mathrm{ProperForcing}_S(P(\\delta),\\vec{\\leq}(\\delta),\\mathcal L_\\in)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\omega_1","display":false}],"bytes":4575,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3949","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-prop-countable-support.md|58-prop-countable-support]]（batch15）"}],"outgoing":["3f578666c473032f","8935dcac821c0104","911508dbd8495663","d3f859dbdd37f018","36d7463d215be751","a9132c2c1a18acd1","ec28b62254928d73","65418b505fc53093"]}